@startuml
title Figure 8: Head of Department - Issue Assignment Process

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Head of\nDepartment" as HOD
participant "Frontend" as UI
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
participant "Issue\nService" as IssueSvc
participant "Notification\nService" as NotifSvc
participant "Email\nService" as Email
database "Database" as DB

== View Department Issues ==

HOD -> UI: Access Issues Page
UI -> API: GET /api/issues/department\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues\nWHERE department = 'Finance'\nAND status IN ('OPEN', 'IN_PROGRESS')
DB --> API: Issue List
API --> UI: {issues[]}
UI --> HOD: Display Issues Table\n(Unassigned & Assigned)

== Assign Issue to Staff ==

HOD -> UI: Click "Assign" on Issue
UI --> HOD: Show Assignment Modal

HOD -> UI: Request Staff List
UI -> API: GET /api/users/department-staff
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE department = 'Finance'\nAND role = 'STAFF'\nAND isActive = true
DB --> API: Staff List
API --> UI: {staff[]}
UI --> HOD: Display Staff Dropdown\n(John Kamanzi, Sarah Ingabire, etc.)

HOD -> UI: Select Staff Member\n(John Kamanzi)
HOD -> UI: Click "Assign"

UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/{id}/assign\n{assignedToId: 201}

API -> IssueSvc: assignIssue(issueId, staffId, hodId)

IssueSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues\nWHERE id = ?
DB --> IssueSvc: Issue Details

alt Issue Not Found
    IssueSvc --> API: Error: Issue Not Found
    API --> UI: 404 Not Found
    UI --> HOD: Error: Issue Not Found
else Issue Found
    IssueSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE id = ? AND role = 'STAFF'
    DB --> IssueSvc: Staff User
    
    alt Staff Not Found
        IssueSvc --> API: Error: Staff Not Found
        API --> UI: 404 Not Found
        UI --> HOD: Error: Invalid Staff Member
    else Staff Found
        IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET assigned_to = ?,\nupdated_at = NOW()\nWHERE id = ?
        DB --> IssueSvc: Issue Updated
        
        IssueSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs\n(user_id=HOD, action='ISSUE_ASSIGNED',\nentity_type='Issue', entity_id)
        DB --> IssueSvc: Audit Log Created
        
        IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: createNotification()\n{userId=Staff, type='ISSUE_ASSIGNED',\ntitle, message, issueId}
        NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(user_id, type, title, message,\nissue_id, is_read=false)
        DB --> NotifSvc: Notification Created
        NotifSvc --> IssueSvc: Notification Sent
        
        IssueSvc -> Email: sendAssignmentEmail()\n{to: staff.email, issue: details}
        Email -> Email: Build HTML Email\n(Issue Title, Priority, Link)
        Email --> IssueSvc: Email Sent
        
        IssueSvc --> API: IssueResponse\n{assigned_to: John Kamanzi}
        API --> UI: 200 OK
        UI --> HOD: Success: Issue Assigned\nto John Kamanzi
    end
end

== Change Issue Priority ==

HOD -> UI: Click "Change Priority"
UI --> HOD: Show Priority Modal\n(Low, Medium, High, Critical)

HOD -> UI: Select Priority: "High"
UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/{id}/priority\n{priority: "High"}

API -> IssueSvc: updatePriority(issueId, priority)
IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET priority = 'High',\nupdated_at = NOW()
DB --> IssueSvc: Priority Updated

IssueSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs\n(action='PRIORITY_CHANGED')
IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyPriorityChange()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(type='PRIORITY_CHANGED')

IssueSvc --> API: Success
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> HOD: Priority Changed to High

== Close Resolved Issue ==

HOD -> UI: View Resolved Issues
UI -> API: GET /api/issues/department?status=RESOLVED
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues\nWHERE status = 'RESOLVED'
DB --> API: Resolved Issues
API --> UI: {issues[]}
UI --> HOD: Display Resolved Issues

HOD -> UI: Review Issue & Click "Close"
UI -> API: PUT /api/issues/{id}/close

API -> IssueSvc: closeIssue(issueId, hodId)
IssueSvc -> DB: UPDATE issues\nSET status = 'CLOSED',\nclosed_by = ?, closed_at = NOW()
DB --> IssueSvc: Issue Closed

IssueSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyIssueClosed()
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification\n(type='ISSUE_CLOSED')
NotifSvc -> Email: sendClosureEmail()

IssueSvc --> API: Success
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> HOD: Issue Closed Successfully

@enduml
